  Result: DENIED ❌
  Reason: "Household income exceeds eligibility threshold for all categories"

Test Case 3: Adult Age 35, Income = $25,000, FPL = $20,000 (125% FPL)
  Rule Evaluated: Approve_Adults
  Result: APPROVED ✅
  Category: Adults
  Income Threshold: 138% FPL

Test Case 4: Non-Resident, Income Qualified
  Rule Evaluated: Deny_NonResident
  Result: DENIED ❌
  Reason: "Applicant must be an Ohio resident"
```

