### Real-World Example 2: Claims Edit Rules

**Context**: Pennsylvania Medicaid requires numerous claim validation rules ("edits") that vary by service type, provider type, and member eligibility. These rules change monthly based on policy updates.

**Implementation**:

```json
{
  "WorkflowName": "PennsylvaniaClaimEdits",
  "Rules": [
    {
      "RuleName": "Edit001_TimelyFiling",
      "ErrorMessage": "Claim exceeds timely filing limit (365 days)",
      "ErrorType": "Error",
      "Severity": "Hard",
      "Expression": "(DateTime.Today - input.ServiceDate).TotalDays > 365"
    },
    {
      "RuleName": "Edit002_DuplicateClaim",
      "ErrorMessage": "Potential duplicate claim detected",
      "ErrorType": "Warning",
      "Severity": "Soft",
